 thralls, Abyssal Ones, achievements

- Monster-infested planet trait: +5% combat, periodic demon raids
- Silverblood can appear as a Hell invader (Warlord) and as thralls
- Endgame: hunt five Abyssal Ones after building a fortress in Hell
- Achievements: Silver Hunter, Unbroken, Abyss Walker, Beast Country;
  feat: The Last Abyssal

